# Loan Default & Credit Risk Analysis

## Project Overview

This project analyzes customer loan data to understand loan default patterns and credit risk.

Python is used for data cleaning, analysis, and visualization. Power BI is used to create an interactive dashboard.

## Objective

* Analyze customer loan data.
* Calculate loan default rates.
* Analyze credit scores, income, and loan amounts.
* Identify factors associated with loan defaults.
* Create an interactive Power BI dashboard.
* Generate useful business insights.

## Dataset

The dataset contains **500 records and 24 columns**.

Important columns include:

* Customer_ID
* Gender
* Age
* Education
* Annual_Income
* Credit_Score
* Loan_Type
* Loan_Amount
* Interest_Rate
* Debt_to_Income_Ratio
* Previous_Defaults
* Region
* Default_Status

