## Key Insights

* Overall loan default rate is **55.2%**.
* Auto Loans have the highest default rate.
* Central region has the highest default rate.
* Lower credit scores generally show higher default patterns.
* Higher DTI ratios are associated with higher default patterns.
* Previous defaults are associated with higher current default patterns.

